  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/P1610052.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(14 fotos) La entrada del Centro Sanitario Integrado (CSI) de Onda ha acogido la ma&ntilde;ana de este mi&eacute;rcoles una jornada en la que responsables de enfermer&iacute;a han ense&ntilde;ado a las personas que han querido c&oacute;mo realizar la reanimaci&oacute;n cardiopulmonar b&aacute;sica para adultos en espacios p&uacute;blicos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610037.jpg\" alt=\"p1610037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610038.jpg\" alt=\"p1610038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610039.jpg\" alt=\"p1610039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610040.jpg\" alt=\"p1610040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610042.jpg\" alt=\"p1610042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610043.jpg\" alt=\"p1610043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610044.jpg\" alt=\"p1610044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reanimaciocardiopulmonarbasicacsionda/p1610046.jpg\" alt=\"p1610046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p